      "repairSkill": "intermediate_vs_final_goods",
      "commonError": "Double-counting intermediate goods instead of counting final value or value added.",
      "q": "A firm imports $500,000 of parts, adds $300,000 of domestic labor and capital services, and sells the final good domestically for $800,000. What is the contribution to domestic GDP?",
