      "commonError": "Counting transactions that are not current domestic production, such as used goods, financial assets, or foreign production.",
      "q": "A country produces only two goods. In 2025 it produces 100 meals at $20 and 50 laptops at $1,000. It imports 10 additional laptops at $900 each for households. What domestic production value is counted in GDP?",
