      "commonError": "Including people outside the labor force or omitting active job seekers from the labor-force total.",
      "q": "An economy begins with 120 million employed and 10 million unemployed. During the month, 4 million unemployed people find jobs, 3 million stop searching, and 5 million people outside the labor force begin searching without finding work. What is the new labor force?",
