      "commonError": "Confusing marginal output with average output per worker.",
      "q": "A workshop has 10 workers. With one machine, output is 100 units; with two machines it is 160; with three it is 200. Workers, hours, and technology stay fixed. What are the extra output from the third machine and output per worker with three machines?",
