      "repairSkill": "growth_policy",
      "commonError": "Incorrectly concludes “Higher saving permanently raises growth at an unchanged rate for every additional machine” in this economic growth policy task.",
      "q": "An economy raises saving to finance new capital but temporarily consumes less. Under diminishing returns with unchanged technology, which comparison is defensible?",
