      "objective": "LO26.4",
      "boss": "Warden",
      "feedback": "Saving reallocates resources from present consumption toward investment. Capital deepening can raise the level of output per worker, with diminishing increments absent continuing technological progress.",
      "aHash": "8f633b44f252d478500ff2dc11c8acf6321ae71d23d58de03c6067e0c9df6390",
