      "tag": "growth_policy",
      "type": "analysis",
      "objective": "LO26.4",
      "boss": "Warden",
      "feedback": "The stated constraint is insecurity of returns, not an electricity shortage. Predictable institutions can encourage investment and exchange; nominal changes alone do not establish real productivity gains.",
      "aHash": "66cb0ea9fea135e8e8fbeb368afeb3aece7c9e0536b5d478694b4caa47379d62",
