      "type": "analysis",
      "objective": "LO26.4",
      "boss": "Warden",
      "feedback": "Innovation can expand productive capacity while creating structural transition costs. Retraining/mobility address the mismatch; aggregate growth alone does not guarantee immediate employment for each displaced worker.",
      "aHash": "eae139fe1a00f98e28afc99adc29b243184098ff1743de9448510d02b73c2b55",
