      "type": "analysis",
      "objective": "LO26.4",
      "boss": "Warden",
      "feedback": "Research incentives can improve the long-run production frontier, but that does not establish an immediate increase in spending sufficient to close an existing recessionary gap. Demand utilization and productive capacity require separate diagnoses.",
