      "repairSkill": "growth_policy",
      "commonError": "Incorrect inference: Transition growth must accelerate; diminishing returns make each later unit more productive.",
      "q": "Saving rises and capital per worker grows, but each extra unit of capital adds less output under unchanged technology. A forecast extends the initial output-growth increase forever. Which correction is warranted?",
