      "boss": "FinalBoss",
      "feedback": "Normal search is frictional and persistent mismatch is structural, so the initial natural rate is 2+3=5%. Better matching makes it 1+3=4%. Recovery removes cyclical unemployment; final actual unemployment therefore equals that 4% natural rate.",
