      "commonError": "Incorrectly concludes “Delayed inclusion proves CPI understates every household's inflation by the same fixed amount” in this cpi bias task.",
      "q": "A new product expands choice while the price index still records spending of $200 on older products. How does the delayed inclusion of the new product limit what the CPI tells us?",
