      "commonError": "Incorrectly concludes “The payment exactly preserves utility because any official index equals every household's cost of living” in this cpi bias task.",
      "q": "A $210 payment is indexed to measured CPI. A careful study estimates measured inflation at 5% but the cost of maintaining the recipient's utility at 3%, owing to substitution and new choices. How does indexation affect the payment's purchasing power under these estimates?",
