      "repairSkill": "growth_policy",
      "commonError": "Incorrectly concludes “Mandate a higher nominal GDP target and infer that skills must improve” in this economic growth policy task.",
      "q": "Firms underinvest in training because employees may leave with their new skills. Which proposal targets that mechanism while recognizing a resource tradeoff?",
