      "id": "ERQ-PM2B3-PROD-LB-001",
      "q": "A firm produces 2,100 units at 10 units per labor hour. Training raises productivity to 12 units per hour while required output rises to 2,520. Management plans to cut total hours because of the training. Can it meet the new output requirement with fewer hours if no further productivity change occurs?",
